# Directory roots the enforce-allowed-dirs hook permits as targets for cd,
# pushd, git -C, npm --prefix, find starting points and rm/mv/cp operands.
# One absolute path per line; blank lines and #-comments are ignored; a
# leading ~ expands to $HOME and a leading $NAME to that environment
# variable (a line whose variable is unset is skipped). Every path is
# canonicalised with realpath -m before use. This copy is baked root:root
# 0444 into the container; on a host, an allowed-dirs.local next to it
# (hand-written, never shipped) takes precedence - see the hook header.

# The agent container's three mounts - see containers/agent/Dockerfile.
/workspace/repo
/workspace/rules
/workspace/tmp
